### 11. Create Terms v1.0
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/terms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "v1.0",
  "title": "Customer Data Privacy Terms",
  "content": "By registering, you agree that your personal data will be stored and processed in accordance with the Data Privacy Act of 2012.",
  "isActive": true,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-13T00:00:00",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-13T00:00:00"
}

### 12. Get Active Terms
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/terms/active
Accept: application/json

